TEXT 48 16 Left 4 ;EEEE2075 | HB100 IF -> BAND-PASS / AMPLIFIER -> ADC + DIGITAL
TEXT 48 64 Left 2 ;V1 from the pasted design. One .asc file; all active-device models are embedded. No downloaded libraries required.
TEXT 48 96 Left 2 ;INPUT: AIN is PEAK volts (default 5 mV = 10 mVpp). FIN is Hz; speed ~ FIN/19.5 km/h. Source impedance RSRC defaults to 1 ohm.
TEXT 48 128 Left 2 ;DEFAULT RUN: transient at 78, 390 and 1170 Hz. Plot V(VIN), V(AMP_OUT), V(ADC_OUT), V(DIGITAL_OUT). Use View -> SPICE Error Log for measurements.
TEXT 48 160 Left 2 ;AC RESPONSE: replace .tran with .ac dec 150 10 100k. Disable .step for one sweep. Plot dB(V(AMP_OUT)/V(VIN)) and ph(V(AMP_OUT)/V(VIN)).
TEXT 48 224 Left 3 ;POWER: common ground; OP07 +/-5 V; radar/MAX882 +5 V; STM32 has its OWN 3.3 V rail.
SYMBOL voltage 96 272 R0
SYMATTR InstName VPLUS
SYMATTR Value 5
FLAG 96 288 V5
FLAG 96 368 0
SYMBOL voltage 304 272 R0
SYMATTR InstName VMINUS
SYMATTR Value -5
FLAG 304 288 VN5
FLAG 304 368 0
SYMBOL voltage 512 272 R0
SYMATTR InstName VSTM
SYMATTR Value 3.3
FLAG 512 288 V3V3_STM
FLAG 512 368 0
