FLAG 768 352 0
TEXT 832 288 Left 2 ;MAX882 functional block generates V3V3_MAX. SET=GND, STBY=+5 V are assumed. C5 is its output capacitor.
TEXT 832 320 Left 2 ;V3V3_MAX and V3V3_STM are separate. LBO pull-up uses the STM32 rail; do not parallel regulator outputs.
TEXT 832 352 Left 2 ;Ideal DC rails model steady-state operation. Power sequencing and real regulator stability are NOT validated.
