TEXT 1120 912 Left 2 ;DIGITAL_OUT: open-drain, 10k pull-up to STM32 3.3 V.
TEXT 1120 944 Left 2 ;LBO is LOW when LBI is below threshold; HIGH above it.
TEXT 1120 976 Left 2 ;CDIG = 20 pF illustrative wiring/GPIO capacitance.
TEXT 1120 1008 Left 2 ;No optional external hysteresis resistor in baseline.
TEXT 1120 1040 Left 2 ;Bias = 3.3*27/(47+27) = 1.204 V; AC factor ~0.2344.
TEXT 1120 1072 Left 2 ;MAX882 speed/propagation delay MUST be checked on hardware.
TEXT 48 1160 Left 2 !XMAX V5 V3V3_MAX LBI DIGITAL_OUT 0 MAX882_FUNC
