TEXT 736 1296 Left 2 ;ADC_OUT ~ 1.65 V + 0.25 * AC(AMP_OUT). Do not connect raw AMP_OUT to the STM32.
TEXT 736 1336 Left 2 ;At 10 mVpp IF and 390 Hz, expect ~2.41 Vpp AMP_OUT and ~0.60 Vpp ADC_OUT.
TEXT 736 1376 Left 2 ;CADC = 10 pF illustrative input capacitance; STM32 switched-cap sampling is not modeled.
TEXT 736 1416 Left 2 ;At a nominal 10 kS/s ADC rate, select enough acquisition time for this ~3.75k source impedance.
TEXT 736 1456 Left 2 ;ADC is not clamped in this V1 circuit; check actual rails, overload and power sequencing before wiring.
TEXT 48 1600 Left 3 ;5 | PARAMETERS / ANALYSES / AUTOMATIC CHECKS
TEXT 48 1648 Left 2 !.param AIN=5m FIN=390 RSRC=1 RF2=220k VTRIP=1.2 VHYS=7m
TEXT 48 1688 Left 2 !.tran 2u 200m 100m 2u
TEXT 48 1728 Left 2 !.step param FIN list 78 390 1170
TEXT 48 1776 Left 2 !.meas tran VIN_PP PP V(VIN) FROM=120m TO=200m\n.meas tran AMP_PP PP V(AMP_OUT) FROM=120m TO=200m\n.meas tran ADC_MIN MIN V(ADC_OUT) FROM=120m TO=200m\n.meas tran ADC_MAX MAX V(ADC_OUT) FROM=120m TO=200m\n.meas tran DIG_MIN MIN V(DIGITAL_OUT) FROM=120m TO=200m\n.meas tran DIG_MAX MAX V(DIGITAL_OUT) FROM=120m TO=200m\n.meas tran LBI_MIN MIN V(LBI) FROM=120m TO=200m\n.meas tran LBI_MAX MAX V(LBI) FROM=120m TO=200m\n.meas tran GAIN PARAM='AMP_PP/VIN_PP'\n.meas tran DIG_PERIOD TRIG V(DIGITAL_OUT) VAL=1.65 RISE=1 TD=120m TARG V(DIGITAL_OUT) VAL=1.65 RISE=2 TD=120m\n.meas tran DIG_HZ PARAM='1/DIG_PERIOD'
TEXT 512 1688 Left 2 !.options method=gear reltol=1e-5
TEXT 1040 1648 Left 2 ;FILTER LIMIT: first-order HP + first-order LP; gradual skirts.
TEXT 1040 1680 Left 2 ;50 Hz is only ~4.5 dB below 390 Hz; 3 kHz ~6.2 dB below.
TEXT 1040 1712 Left 2 ;This cannot establish strict out-of-band rejection or a detection
TEXT 1040 1744 Left 2 ;range without a stopband specification and actual radar data.
TEXT 1040 1792 Left 2 ;To test other frequencies, edit FIN and the .step list.
TEXT 1040 1824 Left 2 ;To test amplitude headroom, change the step to:
TEXT 1040 1856 Left 2 ;.step param AIN list 2.5m 5m 10m
TEXT 1040 1888 Left 2 ;FIN then uses its .param default of 390 Hz.
TEXT 1040 1920 Left 2 ;For noise/threshold sensitivity, vary VTRIP, VHYS, RSRC.
TEXT 48 2112 Left 3 ;6 | EMBEDDED MODELS (editable SPICE directives; engineering approximations, not hardware certification)
TEXT 48 2160 Left 2 !.subckt OP07_APPROX INP INM VP VN OUT\n* Single-pole engineering approximation, NOT a vendor OP07 macro-model.\n* Aol=200k; GBW=600kHz; slew=0.3V/us; Rout=50ohm; rail headroom=1.5V.\nBGM 0 NDOM I=min(max(1m*V(INP,INM),-79.5774715u),79.5774715u)\nRDOM NDOM 0 200Meg\nCDOM NDOM 0 265.2582385p\nBCLIP NDRV 0 V=min(max(V(NDOM),V(VN)+1.5),V(VP)-1.5)\nROUT NDRV OUT 50\n.ends OP07_APPROX
TEXT 1040 2160 Left 2 !.subckt MAX882_FUNC VIN V33 LBI LBO GND\n* Functional surrogate only: ideal 3.3V regulator and low-battery switch.\n* 1.20V threshold, 7mV total hysteresis; no internal delay or tolerance model.\nBREG V33 GND V=min(max(V(VIN,GND)-0.3,0),3.3)\nVREF REF GND {VTRIP}\nSLOW LBO GND REF LBI LBO_SWITCH\n.model LBO_SWITCH SW(Ron=50 Roff=1G Vt=0 Vh={VHYS/2})\n.ends MAX882_FUNC
